**/node_modules
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env.example
# Local virtualenv — we want the Dockerfile to build a fresh one inside the image
**/.venv
**/*.egg-info
# Frontend build artifacts — regenerated inside the container; copying
# them from the host into the image layer adds 100s+ to `exporting layers`
# because they're hundreds of MB of small files.
**/.webpack-cache
**/dist
Frontend/tools/dist
# IDE / OS noise
**/.DS_Store
**/.vscode
**/.idea
# Tests & docs aren't needed in the runtime image
**/__tests__
**/*.log
